### Seed Data: Items (Shirts)

### Login (Establish Session)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{TEST_USERNAME}}",
    "password": "{{TEST_USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

###

# ==================== ITEM CATEGORIES ====================

### Create Item Category: Shirts
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/item-categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "CAT_SHIRTS",
  "name": "Shirts",
  "description": "All types of shirts"
}

###

# ==================== ITEMS ====================

### Create Item: Basic Shirt
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SHIRT_0001",
  "name": "Basic Shirt",
  "description": "Standard basic t-shirt",
  "baseUomId": 8,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Create Item: Premium Shirt
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SHIRT_0002",
  "name": "Premium Shirt",
  "description": "High quality premium t-shirt",
  "baseUomId": 8,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "isActive": true
}

###

# ==================== VERIFICATION ====================

### List All Items (Cursor Pagination)
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/items
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Search Items by Code
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/items?search=SHIRT
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List Items with Cursor Pagination
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/items?limit=5
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List Items with Cursor
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/items?cursor=10&limit=5
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Filter Items by Category
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/items?categoryId=1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Filter Items by Active Status
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/items?isActive=true
Content-Type: application/json

###
